-correct-size%402x.png","line":107,"embedded":true},{"title":"A checkmark in a circle to indicate correct usage.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/88662da92338267bb64cd2275c84e484/checkmark%402x.png","line":109,"embedded":true},{"title":"Creating Live Activity layouts","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/live-activities#Creating-Live-Activity-layouts","line":111},{"title":"Specifications","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/live-activities#Specifications","line":113},{"title":"Apple Design Resources","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/resources/","line":117},{"title":"An illustration that shows content in the Dynamic Island with even margins.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/08f636dea59d0355bbc0c42d67026509/live-activities-margins%402x.png","line":119,"embedded":true},{"title":"`ContainerRelativeShape`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/SwiftUI/ContainerRelativeShape","line":121},{"title":"An illustration a Live Activity that draws content to the edge of the Dynamic Island.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/881638db784a565ec2af57941e8dec5d/live-activities-rounded-shapes%402x.png","line":123,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration that shows how a Live Activity places an icon too far from the edge of the Dynamic Island.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/f6ab85a99b55f39774f71e5f03d22455/live-activities-content-incorrect-position%402x.png","line":127,"embedded":true},{"title":"An X in a circle to indicate incorrect usage.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/209f6f0fc8ad99d9bf59e12d82d06584/crossout%402x.png","line":129,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration that shows how a Live Activity places an icon close to the edge of the Dynamic Island without poking into the rounded shape of the Dynamic Island.","target":"https://docs-assets.